Package: rladybugdb
Title: R Interface to LadybugDB Embedded Graph Database
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raden Muhammad", "Hadi", email = "hadimaster65555@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides an R interface to LadybugDB, an embedded columnar graph
    database using the Cypher query language. LadybugDB was formerly known as
    Kuzu. This package uses native Rcpp bindings to
    the LadybugDB C library, requiring no Python runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C++17, OpenSSL 3 (required by upstream LadybugDB binaries)
Imports:
    DBI (>= 1.2.0),
    methods,
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0),
    rlang (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    arrow,
    bit64,
    DBItest,
    tibble,
    igraph,
    tidygraph,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
